\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(1) \\\\  & =5\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({e}^{x})+0 \\\\  & =5{e}^{x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope of the tangent at $x=0$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=0} & ={(5{e}^{x})\\,|}_{x=0} \\\\  & =5{e}^{0} \\\\  & =5\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =5.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533665 true] [17592186245224 1000 #edb/ref 17592186245225 13194139533665 true] [17592186245224 1000 #edb/ref 17592186245226 13194139533665 true] [17592186245224 1000 #edb/ref 17592186245227 13194139533665 true] [17592186245224 1000 #edb/ref 17592186245228 13194139533665 true] [17592186245224 1000 #edb/ref 17592186245229 13194139533665 true] [17592186245224 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533665 true] [17592186245224 1041 "selection" 13194139533665 true] [17592186245224 1104 #edb/ref 17592186245228 13194139533665 true] [17592186245224 1110 #uuid "31c58275-d3e3-584a-8929-d5aead0b0695" 13194139533665 true] [17592186245225 1034 "1" 13194139533665 true] [17592186245225 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533665 true] [17592186245225 1111 #uuid "13ccd40c-0532-5362-a8ab-8899ae46bbda" 13194139533665 true] [17592186245226 1034 "0" 13194139533665 true] [17592186245226 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533665 true] [17592186245226 1111 #uuid "f936e2c5-bb90-5d98-8e50-7f79279bc89c" 13194139533665 true] [17592186245227 1034 "-1" 13194139533665 true] [17592186245227 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533665 true] [17592186245227 1111 #uuid "afd0be6c-6058-575e-87f5-515c036dc8cf" 13194139533665 true] [17592186245228 1034 "5" 13194139533665 true] [17592186245228 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533665 true] [17592186245228 1111 #uuid "2c8e8f7d-6782-50d3-aa4c-e69b9df8ef08" 13194139533665 true] [17592186245229 1034 "ln⁡5" 13194139533665 true] [17592186245229 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533665 true] [17592186245229 1111 #uuid "7f0210e5-8a8f-511b-b027-ed23976105f5" 13194139533665 true] [17592186245230 1017 #edb/ref 17592186245231 131